  "rating": "5",
  "item_short_desc": "<p>Discover comfort and style with our Womens Vintage Paratrooper Fatigue Pants. Crafted from a super soft ramie / cotton fabric blend (Tiger Stripe Camo = cotton / polyester), the baggy cargo pants offer an easy-going, lightweight, and comfortable vintage fit and feel throughout the day, making them the ideal choice for outdoor activities and everyday wear.</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
  "sort_order": "12079",
  "description": "<p>Discover comfort and style with our Womens Vintage Paratrooper Fatigue Pants. Crafted from a super soft ramie / cotton fabric blend (Tiger Stripe Camo = cotton / polyester), the baggy cargo pants offer an easy-going, lightweight, and comfortable vintage fit and feel throughout the day, making them the ideal choice for outdoor activities and everyday wear. Perfect Fit: These low-rise pants sit below the belly button for a comfortable and flattering fit, showcasing a roomy and baggy Y2K design. In addition, the adjustable drawstring waist and ankles allow you to customize the cargos for the perfect look. No Bag Needed: Our Womens Vintage Paratrooper Fatigue Pants feature 2 front hand pockets, 2 side cargo pockets, 2 low-profile calf pockets, and 2 button-down back pockets for on-the-go essentials. Complete the Look: Available in both solid and camo colors, these fashionable and casual cargo pants work great with our Womens Camo T-Shirts and Womens Tank Tops. Action &amp; Adventure Ready: From outdoor adventures to streetwear fashion, the womens paratrooper pants are perfect for hiking, skating, lounging around, everyday wear, and more.</p>",
